{"id":"odu-pr99-green","parent":"oduc-build","ord":"a1","title":"PR: dependabot's fast-uri bump (odu#99) shepherded to green and merged","done":"2026-09-03T07:55:24-04:00","started":"2026-09-03T07:47:47-04:00","worked":457,"desc":"The human's order 2026-09-03 ~07:45 ET: dispatch opencode on juspay/odu#99 (dependabot: fast-uri 3.1.5 → 3.1.7 in /website, a security release) and merge on green CI. The agent shepherds a PR it did not write: checks the bump and the lockfile hold together, fixes on the PR branch only what the bump itself needs, reports. Review waived — the agent's read IS the review of a one-line bump (assumption stated to the human). The orchestrator runs odu's CI on both platforms and merges.","see":["odu-pr86-green"],"created":"2026-09-03T07:47:30-04:00","changed":"2026-09-03T07:55:24-04:00","custom":{"agent":"agent-opencode","brief":"briefs/odu-pr99-green.md","dispatched":"2026-09-03T07:48:00-04:00","from":"the human 2026-09-03 ~07:45 ET: dispatch opencode on odu#99 and merge on green CI","kolu-terminal":"a3796a7c","merge":"merge-auto","merge-commit":"https://github.com/juspay/odu/commit/a7e0e21b","merged":"2026-09-03","odu-worktree":".worktrees/pr99-fast-uri","pr-url":"https://github.com/juspay/odu/pull/99","repo":"repo-odu","tier":"mechanical","timings":"shepherd 3m23s (opencode, nothing to change) · review waived · ci ~2m 18/18 both platforms · merge <1m — TOTAL ~8m (07:48 → 07:56 ET)"}}
{"id":"lane-o99-implement","parent":"odu-pr99-green","ord":"a0","title":"shepherd the PR: verify the bump, fix only what it needs, report","done":"2026-09-03T07:52:37-04:00","started":"2026-09-03T07:47:47-04:00","worked":290,"desc":"Shepherd's report (opencode, 3m23s): head 997e29be sits on master's tip, no merge needed; npm ci confirms manifest and lockfile agree on fast-uri 3.1.7; the website's astro build is green; the whole diff is three lines of website/package-lock.json, a file no CI lane or suite consumes. Nothing changed, nothing pushed.","created":"2026-09-03T07:47:30-04:00","changed":"2026-09-03T07:52:37-04:00"}
